# terraform.tfvars is now COMMITTED (it holds only values that are already public), so there is
# nothing to copy for the ordinary case — `tofu plan` works from a fresh clone.
#
# The ONE file you must create is emails.auto.tfvars, which is gitignored because it holds
# personal addresses and this repo is public:
#
#   e2e_budget_alert_emails = ["you@example.com"]
#
# It is a REQUIRED variable with no default, deliberately. It feeds BOTH the Budget's direct
# subscribers and the SNS subscriptions, so a default of [] made a bare apply silently
# unsubscribe the maintainer from their own cost alerts. Pass [] explicitly to opt out.
#
# You also need backend.hcl (see backend.hcl.example) for the remote state.
